#: ../../how-to/cli.md:36 647378abe3e2400d8b97c0b73b1b4e4f
msgid "Using GWpy CLI"
msgstr "GWpy CLI の使用"

#: ../../how-to/cli.md:38 380ac0ed73a34318bbc2d97ba70514d5
msgid ""
"If you need GWpy's command-line tools, refer to the [GWpy "
"Documentation](https://gwpy.readthedocs.io/en/latest/cli/) directly. GWexpy "
"does not currently provide a documented compatibility layer that forwards "
"the full GWpy CLI surface."
msgstr ""
"GWpy のコマンドラインツールを利用したい場合は、[GWpy "
"ドキュメント](https://gwpy.readthedocs.io/en/latest/cli/)を直接参照してください。GWexpy "
"は現在、GWpy CLI 全体を透過的に転送する互換レイヤを文書化していません。"

#: ../../how-to/cli.md:40 6035a3db8d7b4ea1b185618d76e3fe34
msgid ""
"**Note:** For complex analysis pipelines, gravitational wave parameter "
"estimation, and custom data processing, the **Python API** is recommended. "
"See the [Getting Started](../tutorials/getting_started.md) guide for API "
"examples."
msgstr ""

